## API & Networking

### Client

- `ApiClient` wraps Dio `get/post/put/delete`
- Base URL: `--dart-define=API_BASE_URL=…`, default `https://api.yalla5roga.com`
- Timeouts: 30s connect/receive
- JSON `Content-Type` / `Accept`
- **Do not invent endpoints.** Add new ones only in `ApiConstants`.

### Existing endpoints (`ApiConstants`)

- `POST /auth/login` `{phone, password}`
- `POST /auth/register` `{name, phone, password}`
- `GET /me/unread-counts`
- `GET /notifications`
- `POST /notifications/read` (mark all)
- `POST /notifications/{id}/read`
- `POST /outings/{outingId}/chat/read`
- `POST /groups/{groupId}/read`

### Payload pattern

Envelope: prefer `body['data']` if it is a `Map`, else the body (`apiPayload`). Helpers: `apiInt`, `apiBool`, `apiString`.

Models extend entities and implement `fromJson`.

### Auth token

`AuthInterceptor` reads `AppConstants.tokenKey` (`auth_token`) and sets `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Token is written by `AuthLocalDataSource.cacheUser` when `user.token` is non-null. Logout removes `cached_user` and `auth_token`.

### Errors

`ErrorInterceptor` maps Dio errors → `NetworkException` / `AuthException` (401/403) / `ServerException`. Datasources unwrap `DioException.error` if it is `AppException`. Repos use `guardRemote`: offline → `NetworkFailure`; `AuthException` → `AuthFailure`; other `AppException` → `ServerFailure`.

Auth login/register is special: on connectivity, call API and cache; on `AuthException` return `AuthFailure`; on other API errors **or** offline, cache a **demo user** and succeed (preview fallback while backend is incomplete). Do not remove this unless the task says so.

### Exception: Nominatim

`PickLocationProvider` / `PlaceSearchProvider` call `nominatim.openstreetmap.org` with `package:http` and `User-Agent: Yalla5roga/1.0`. Not Dio, not `ApiConstants`.

