## Navigation

No named routes / `GetPage` table. `GetMaterialApp(home: …)` plus imperative GetX:

- `Get.to(() => Page())` push
- `Get.off(() => Page())` replace
- `Get.offAll(() => Page())` clear stack
- `Get.back(result: …)` pop
- `Get.dialog` / `Get.bottomSheet` / `Get.showSnackbar` (`AppAlert`, `ImageSourceSheet`, `AppSnackBar`)

### Main flow

Unauthenticated: `SplashPage` → `AuthPage` → success `Get.offAll(MainShell)`.

Authenticated on launch: `MainShell` tabs (IndexedStack):

0. `HomePage`
1. `GroupsPage`
2. `OutingsPage`
3. `SettingsPage` from **`features/setting`**

Logout / delete-account: clear unread providers, `AuthProvider.logout()`, `Get.offAll(AuthPage)`.

### Important screens

- Groups: `CreateGroupPage`, `GroupDetailsPage(groupId:)` (live detail; marks group read)
- Outings: `CreateOutingPage`, `EventPage`, `OutingChatPage` (marks chat read), `PickLocationPage`, `SavedOutingsPage`
- `DiscoverPage`, `NotificationsPage` (marks all read on open)
- Settings: `ProfileInfoPage` (help/privacy/terms), `AboutDeveloperPage`

Quick actions (home): create outing, special event, create group, discover.

