## Authentication & Authorization

- Phone-first Egyptian numbers (`Validators`: `1[0125]` + 8 digits, stored as `+20…`)
- UI: send OTP is **local** (snackbar + `auth.sendOtp()`). There is **no OTP API**. Submit sends the 4-digit OTP as `password` to login/register
- Session: cached `User` in prefs; `isAuthenticated` iff `_user != null`
- `updateProfile` saves locally only (no profile API)
- `GroupRole` (owner/admin/member) is demo-group metadata, not app-wide RBAC
- Delete account currently logs out locally; no delete-user endpoint
- `SettingsProvider.pushEnabled` is UI-only

