## Important Project-Specific Rules

- Live settings live in `lib/features/setting/`. `lib/features/groups` detail screen is `GroupDetailsPage(groupId:)`. `lib/features/profile/` still has leftover pages that import from `setting`; do **not** add new settings UI there or wire `MainShell` to profile.
- Groups/outings/discover/chat **content** is demo/local. Do not add API CRUD for them unless new endpoints are first added to `ApiConstants`.
- OTP send is UI-only; login/register currently posts OTP as `password`.
- Keep auth demo-user fallback unless explicitly asked to require a live API.
- Nominatim stays on `package:http`; app API stays on Dio/`ApiClient`.
- Phone validation is Egyptian-only; do not switch to generic email/password without updating `Validators` + auth UI.
- Persist new prefs keys in `AppConstants`, not magic strings.
- `flutter: generate: false` — do not introduce `.arb`/gen-l10n unless asked; extend `l10n.dart`.
- Android applicationId `com.example.yalla_5roga`; iOS bundle `com.example.yalla5roga`. Permissions already include internet, camera, photos, location. WhatsApp/maps query schemes exist — use `AppLauncher`.
- No `test/` directory. Do not add a new DI package. Do not add Firebase unless asked.
- Root `index.html` is design reference only; do not treat it as a backend or Flutter web entry (web uses `web/`).
